      "message": "prefer return early on error to avoid nesting, also try to avoid casting int to bool as much as possible to make code more readable\n\ne.g.\n\n\n```\n// Move this as the first check after reading avrcp_version at line 1267\nif (avrcp_version \u003d\u003d 0) {\n  LOG_INFO(\"Did not find AVRCP entry for device %s\", bdaddr-\u003eToString().c_str());\n  return;\n}\n```\n\n```\nif (!osi_property_get_bool(AVRC_DYNAMIC_AVRCP_ENABLE_PROPERTY, false)) {\n  LOG_INFO(\"Dynamic AVRCP version feature is not enabled, skipping this method\");\n  return;\n}\n```",
