      "writtenOn": "2022-06-23T07:23:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: actually this step is not really needed, btif_config_get_bin() will set version_value_size to the actual size value after read\n\nsee: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/main/shim/config.cc;l\u003d127?q\u003dpackages%2Fmodules%2FBluetooth%2Fsystem%2Fmain%2Fshim%2Fconfig.cc\n\nHence, you just need to call btif_config_get_bin() first and then compare the modified version_value_size with sizeof(cached_version)\n\ne.g.\n```\nuint16_t cached_version \u003d 0;\nsize_t version_value_size \u003d sizeof(cached_version);\n\nif (!btif_config_get_bin(bdaddr-\u003eToString(),\n                         AVRCP_CONTROLLER_VERSION_CONFIG_KEY,\n                         static_cast\u003cuint8_t*\u003e(\u0026cached_version),\n                         \u0026version_value_size)) {\n  LOG_INFO(\n        \"no cached AVRC Controller version for %s. \"\n        \"Reply default AVRC Target version %x.\",\n        bdaddr-\u003eToString().c_str(), avrcp_version);\n  return;\n}\nif (version_value_size !\u003d sizeof(cached_version)) {\n  // handle this error;\n  return;\n}\nif (!spdu_is_avrcp_version_valid(cached_version)) {\n        LOG_ERROR(\n            \"cached AVRC Controller version %x of %s is not valid. \"\n            \"Reply default AVRC Target version %x.\",\n            cached_version, bdaddr-\u003eToString().c_str(), avrcp_version);\n        return;\n}\n\nif (avrcp_version \u003e cached_version) {\n     LOG_INFO(\n          \"Cached AVRCP Controller version %x of %s is smaller than SDP entry.\"\n          \"Set to cached version %x instead.\",\n            cached_version, bdaddr-\u003eToString().c_str(), cached_version);\n        uint8_t* p_version \u003d p_attr-\u003evalue_ptr + 6;\n        UINT16_TO_BE_FIELD(p_version, cached_version);\n} else {\n     LOG_INFO(\n           \"Cached AVRCP Controller version %x of %s is larger than new entry.\"\n           \"Keep SDP AVRCP version %x.\",\n           cached_version, bdaddr-\u003eToString().c_str(), avrcp_version);\n}\n```\n                         \n                         \n                         \nNote: for static_cast, this is a good article to read:\n\nhttps://stackoverflow.com/questions/332030/when-should-static-cast-dynamic-cast-const-cast-and-reinterpret-cast-be-used",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1289,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1289,
        "endChar": 59
      },
      "revId": "4f79a9995a4bc3409dfa76783bde0718e5109f1a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2466d199_dbcb3888",
        "filename": "system/stack/sdp/sdp_utils.cc",
